2026-07-27T07:52:31.0051855Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T07:52:31.0112495Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:52:31.0113094Z i /tmp/RtmpqK4hKB/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:52:31.0113511Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:52:31.0114188Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:52:31.0114765Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:52:31.0115410Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:52:31.0116369Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:52:31.0117095Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T07:52:31.0343840Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:52:31.0452666Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:52:31.0855601Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:52:31.1001844Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
